" style="border-top:1px solid #E7E6E1;padding:14px 16px 14px 0;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#76766F;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;">Valid until</td><td valign="top" style="border-top:1px solid #E7E6E1;padding:14px 0;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#161616;">[Date, if your quote has one]</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding:0 48px;"><p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#3D3D3B;font-weight:normal;">If anything is unclear, or you’d like to change the scope, just reply. I’m happy to adjust it so it fits what you need.</p><p style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#3D3D3B;font-weight:normal;">When you’re ready, you can pick a start date here:</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:6px 0 30px 0;">
<tr><td align="left" bgcolor="{{brand.color|#111111}}" style="border-radius:6px;background-color:{{brand.color|#111111}};">
